  "translation": "Mme batho ba Hai ba ba otla ka hara bona ho ka bang mashome a mararo a metso e tsheletseng ea banna, mme ba ba phalla pele ho sebatla ho fihlela Shebarime, mme ba ba otla thoko-hodimo; mme pelo ea sechaba e ile ea qhibiliha, eaba e ba ⟨e tshwana le⟩ metsi.",
